wg-shield-examine-capacity = Heat per point of absorbed damage: { $rate }. Heat capacity: { $capacity }. Overload threshold: { $overload }.
wg-shield-examine-capacity-note = Power demand may cap heat capacity below the overload threshold.
wg-shield-examine-adds-capacity = On a ship, adds its capacity and cooling to the hull's own.
wg-shield-examine-hull-cooling = Hull share of cooling: { $hull } heat/s.
wg-shield-examine-hull-capacity = Hull capacity: { $hull }. Ship total: { $total }.
wg-shield-examine-recharge = Cooling: { $online } heat/s; recharging: { $offline } heat/s.
wg-shield-examine-power = Power: { $idle } kW idle, { $maximum } kW maximum.
wg-shield-examine-overload = Overload cooldown: { $seconds } s.
wg-shield-examine-deflector = Deflector: solid rounds pass through with { $reduction }% less damage. Stops missiles and energy weapons.
wg-shield-examine-arc = Maximum field arc: { $arc }°. Outside the arc is unprotected.
wg-shield-examine-cost = While raised: -{ $thrust }% thrust, -{ $turn }% turning, larger sensor signature; each hit adds more.
wg-shield-examine-gun-lock = A collapse from overheating locks guns for { $seconds } s. Lowering the field manually does not.
wg-shield-examine-cooling = Cooling: { $online } heat/s field raised, { $down } heat/s field down, { $offline } heat/s while venting. Absorbed heat is held under a raised field until { $hold } s pass without a hit.
wg-shield-collapse-heat = On collapse, heat drops to { $share }%.
wg-shield-examine-one-per-ship = Only one shield generator per ship.
wg-shield-limit-anchor-fail = This ship already has { $generator } installed. Only one shield generator per ship.
